# This file exists only so `web/build` is a non-empty directory in a fresh
# git checkout. //go:embed (web/embed.go) fails to compile if its target
# directory is missing or empty -- see the comment in .gitignore.
#
# Heads up: `npm run build` clears this whole directory before writing the
# real frontend output, deleting this file along with it. That's expected --
# once a real build exists, .gitkeep isn't needed for the embed to work. If
# you commit after building locally, check `git status` before staging: it's
# easy to accidentally commit that deletion (this file has already been
# accidentally deleted and re-added once for exactly that reason).
